prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/AGENTS.md:18:This constitution carries compact always-on semantics from the coding, tool, guardrail, retrieval, and evaluation surfaces of the stack without becoming a governance archive.
